      "title": "Video edit: replace the background of a clip with one color",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Video edit: replace the background of a clip with one color\n\nFinds the subject of every frame of your clip with BiRefNet and places it over one flat color, with the sound kept or left out. Built from Comfy's template utility_birefnet_remove_background.\n\n## Models\n\n- [birefnet.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/BiRefNet/resolve/main/background_removal/birefnet.safetensors): BiRefNet, by ZhengPeng7, [MIT](https://huggingface.co/ZhengPeng7/BiRefNet).\n\nRosesfield ships no weights. Each loader lists its file with a download link.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT. Built from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, MIT, per NOTICE."
      ],
